{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三徧請已，同聲稱讚，下同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至此，或陳敘，或讀疏，稱祖師名，下同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下皆倣此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下皆倣之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "執爐，同聲思過，乞懺，下同"}
